      ⍝ regression (Blake McBride, Bugs28 #68, 2026-08-11): ⊂/⍬ gave 0
      ⍝ (a bare numeric scalar) instead of an error -- unlike ∪/⍬, ∩/⍬,
      ⍝ ⍳/⍬ and ⍷/⍬, which already correctly failed because their classes
      ⍝ derive from NonscalarFunction. Bif_F12_PARTITION (⊂) instead
      ⍝ derived from NonscalarFunction_default_identity, whose generic
      ⍝ eval_identity_fun() treats a 0-length reduction axis as if ⊂ had
      ⍝ the same kind of identity as ,/ or +/ -- but enclose has none.
      ⍝ Now derives from NonscalarFunction like its siblings, so the base
      ⍝ Function::eval_identity_fun() is reached instead.
      ⍝
      ⍝ Revised 2026-09-23: that base default used to DOMAIN_ERROR here,
      ⍝ matching the LRM's own text ("an attempt to reduce an empty
      ⍝ argument with a defined function generates a DOMAIN ERROR") and
      ⍝ ISO 13751's Table 5 ("all others -- Signal domain-error"). Both
      ⍝ get the error class wrong by this codebase's own convention
      ⍝ (DOMAIN_ERROR is for bad ravel content, never a bad shape;
      ⍝ LENGTH_ERROR is for a bad length when some other length at the
      ⍝ same rank would work, which is exactly this case -- ⊂/1 2 3 or
      ⍝ ⊂/,5 work fine, only the length-0 axis fails) -- now LENGTH_ERROR.
      ⍝
      Z←⊂/⍬
LENGTH ERROR+
      Z←⊂/⍬
        ^
      )MORE
Function ⊂ has no identity function, needed to reduce along axis 0 of B (⍴B is 0), whose length there is 0
      )SIC

      ⍝ control: the rank-2 empty case already gave an error
      ⍝
      ⊂/3 0⍴0
LENGTH ERROR+
      ⊂/3 0⍴0
      ^
      )SIC

      ⍝ control: ∪/⍬ (and ∩/⍬, ⍳/⍬, ⍷/⍬ the same way) were already right
      ⍝
      ]FILE_CTL SKIP_APL2   ⍝ ∪ ∩ ⍬ are GNU APL extensions
      ∪/⍬
LENGTH ERROR+
      ∪/⍬
      ^
      )SIC

      ⍝ regression: ,/0 0⍴0 (reducing along a 0-length axis whose OTHER
      ⍝ axis is also 0, so enclosed_identity()'s per-position loop never
      ⍝ runs) left Z with no explicit prototype at all, defaulting to a
      ⍝ bare untyped scalar (≡Z 1, Z←0⍴0) instead of the identity item
      ⍝ every real position would have gotten (≡Z 2, Z←0⍴⊂⍬).
      ⍝
      ]FILE_CTL NO_SKIP
      Z←,/0 0⍴0
      Z≡0⍴⊂⍬
1

